5\. Authorization failures pass regression tests <code>🐞 Bug</code> <code>≡ Correctness</code>

<pre>
<b><i>runHostedCase</i></b> catches exceptions, extracts no error code from ordinary <b><i>Error</i></b> values, and passes
that undefined code to <b><i>assessHostedCase</i></b>. A network failure, malformed successful response, or
non-OAuth HTTP error during an expected allowed case is consequently classified as allowed and
returned with <b><i>status: &quot;passed&quot;</i></b>.
</pre>


