12\. Missing codes pass authorization tests <code>🐞 Bug</code> <code>≡ Correctness</code>

<pre>
The authorization-code exchange substitutes <b><i>fixture.token.code</i></b> when the authorization response has
no <b><i>code</i></b> parameter in its redirect. A target that returns a malformed redirect or even a
non-redirect successful authorization response can still receive the canned code and have the
expected-success fixture marked passed.
</pre>


