- mcpfn/testing/src/host-authorization.ts[350-353]
Recommended Fix
Require a redirect authorization response containing a non-empty `code` before making the token request. Remove the fixture-code fallback for authorization-code grants and return a failed result when the response is not a valid successful authorization redirect.
