fixture defines and uses a resource indicator during authorization and code exchange. Targets that
enable <b><i>requireRefreshResource</i></b> reject these expected-success refresh fixtures with
<b><i>invalid_target</i></b>, leaving that supported profile untestable through this harness.
</pre>


