          "url": "https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#discussion_r3989122941",
          "body": "<!-- cubic:v=53b51beb-28a5-4385-8e69-47b6bd64a2a8 -->\n<!-- cubic:review-run=8573c2f6-1ad4-5200-b1fc-e843db550a1e -->\n<!-- metadata:{\"confidence\":9} -->\nP2: When a custom or stdio target's close rejects, this catch does not run because `McpFnClient.close()` swallows handle-close errors. The suite can therefore return `ok: true` and `complete` after passed scenarios despite failed cleanup; propagate or emit close failures before building the report.\n\n"
