          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Redact errors from authenticated inspect**\n\nWhen an authenticated server includes the opaque credential in a rejected inventory operation, `inspector.snapshot()` rejects before this newly added successful-result redaction runs; `runCli` then writes the raw error message to stderr. For example, a `tools/list` JSON-RPC error that echoes the API-key value leaks the environment-backed secret even though successful snapshots are scrubbed. The fresh evidence is that the new redaction covers only the resolved snapshot, not its rejection path.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
