          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Retain leases when pre-handle cleanup fails**\n\nIf credential-header validation or transport construction throws after acquisition and `revoke` transiently rejects, this `await release()` rejects and the only lease reference is discarded before any handle reaches the client. No later `close()` can retry revocation, while the credential may remain valid and its value remains retained in `state.active`. The fresh evidence is this pre-handle failure path, which is outside the new client-side retained-handle cleanup logic; retain or retry the lease here before abandoning it.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
