          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Require JSON media types for successful token responses**\n\nFor either authorization-code exchange or refresh, a server can return HTTP 200 with `Content-Type: text/plain` and a JSON-looking body; `Response.json()` still parses it, so the hosted case is reported as passed despite the invalid OAuth token-response envelope. Apply the existing JSON media-type validation to successful token responses before accepting their fields.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
