          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Retain every lease until cleanup succeeds**\n\nWhen an authenticated open succeeds but MCP initialization subsequently fails, this catch is never entered, so the lease is absent from `pendingReleases`. `McpFnTestClient.connectTarget()` can then retry `session.close()` once, swallow a second revocation failure, and discard the session containing the retained handle; even `target.cleanup()` has no reference to that lease, leaving a credential that would succeed on a later retry active indefinitely. Register each acquired lease as pending immediately and remove it only after successful release.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
