          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Preserve runtime exit classification after inspect errors**\n\nWhen `inspector.connect()`, `snapshot()`, or `close()` throws an `McpFnClientError`, this catch replaces it with a plain `Error`. The outer CLI handler therefore returns the usage exit code `2` instead of the documented runtime/test-failure code `1`; for example, `mcpfn inspect` against an unreachable endpoint is misclassified as invalid command usage. Redact the error while preserving its type/code.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
