          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Report the actual final OAuth response status**\n\nWhen an allowed fixture ends at the authorization callback without a token request, its only successful response is normally a 302 redirect, but the result reports `responseStatus: 200`; similarly, any accepted non-200 2xx token response is rewritten to 200. This fabricates transport evidence even though rejection paths preserve the real response status, so retain the status of the last validated response instead of hard-coding it.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
