          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Classify direct refresh grants as token refresh**\n\nWhen a caller supplies a fixture with `grantType: \"refresh_token\"` and `refreshToken`—for example, to test an expired refresh token—the request is correctly constructed as a refresh grant, but its phase remains `token-exchange`. A fixture expecting `phase: \"token-refresh\"` therefore fails even when the server returns the expected OAuth rejection, and reports misattribute successful direct refreshes as exchanges; select the phase from the configured grant type before issuing the request.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
