          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Preserve diagnostic discriminators during custom redaction**\n\nFor a custom target whose opaque credential equals an authored diagnostic value such as `transport-close` or `failed`, applying the target hook to the whole diagnostic rewrites `phase` or `outcome`. The client-event path now rebuilds its envelope, but this diagnostic path still corrupts typed events, so suite cleanup detection and diagnostic consumers can miss the actual failure; redact payload fields separately and reconstruct the diagnostic envelope.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
