          "url": "https://github.com/21nCo/super-functions/pull/170#discussion_r4012689199",
          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Mark fallback client events as omitted**\n\nWhen a custom target redactor throws while processing a client event, this catch delivers a synthetic event under the original `kind` without any omission provenance recognized by consumers. An `events.expect` scenario that only checks the kind can therefore pass, and the inspector reports `timelineComplete: true`, even though the real payload was discarded. The fresh fallback now preserves and delivers the event rather than losing it, but it still needs an omission marker that the scenario runner and inspector count.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
        }
