          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Preserve cleanup ownership when connection fails**\n\nWhen initialization or target opening fails and the subsequent cleanup also continues to fail, this suppresses the cleanup rejection and rethrows the original connection error. Because `connectTarget()` never returns `client`, the caller has no owner on which to retry `close()`, so a retained transport or credential-provider lease can remain active permanently; propagate an error that retains a cleanup operation or otherwise keep retry ownership reachable.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
