          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Validate OAuth error responses before accepting rejections**\n\nFor expected-rejection fixtures, any response containing an OAuth `error` is accepted before its transport envelope is validated. Consequently, `chatgpt-unregistered-redirect` can pass when the server redirects to the unregistered drifted URI or returns a mismatched state with `error=invalid_request`, and the unsupported-grant case can pass with an HTTP 200 JSON error. Validate the phase-appropriate status and, for authorization redirects, the callback destination and state before assessing the error code.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
