          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Scrub acquired credentials from inspect snapshots**\n\nWhen the new authenticated `inspect` option is used against a server that reflects the opaque API key or bearer token in initialization metadata or inventory (for example, a tool description), `McpFnInspector.snapshot()` only performs credential-pattern redaction and the raw acquired value remains in stdout and `--output`. The target-suite path explicitly applies `redactTargetCredentials`, but this inspect path does not, so the option advertised as producing a redacted snapshot can leak its credential.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
