          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Retain handles whose credential cleanup fails**\n\nWhen an authenticated target's protocol closes remotely, or an in-progress open is aborted, the client calls this helper with `strict=false` and then discards the only handle reference. If the credential provider's `revoke` or `dispose` rejects, this catch silently consumes the failure; despite the authenticated handle resetting its close promise for a retry, no later `client.close()` can reach it, and the remote-close path even reports cleanup as succeeded. Preserve the handle for retry or retry credential cleanup before swallowing the transport-close error.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
