          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Use a fresh signal context for credential cleanup**\n\nWhen `close()` aborts a connection while this target is opening or initializing, `targetContext.signal` becomes permanently aborted, yet the same context is retained by `acquireRemoteCredential()` and later passed to the provider's `revoke` and `dispose` methods. A provider that uses the supplied signal for its revocation request will therefore fail every immediate and retained cleanup retry, potentially leaving the credential active indefinitely. Supply cleanup with a separate non-aborted signal or context.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
