          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Snapshot credentials before asynchronous conformance**\n\nWhen a custom provider returns a shared mutable `Headers`, another acquisition or token rotation can change it while the runner is active. The proxy has already copied and injected the original value, but this post-run redaction rereads `lease.credential.headers`, so reflected output containing the original token no longer matches and can leak in the returned report; revocation may also receive the replacement token. Snapshot the acquired headers and opaque values once, and use that snapshot for proxy injection and redaction throughout the lease.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
