          "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Redact decoded Basic credentials**\n\nWhen a custom credential uses HTTP Basic authentication, this registers only the full header and its Base64 token. A server that decodes the header and reflects the username or password in an error, tool result, or diagnostic therefore exposes those credential components in reports and inspector artifacts. The new generic scheme extraction covers custom schemes but omits Basic's decoded components; decode valid Basic tokens and register both components as secrets.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎."
